{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"799f6d48c28e9d0ec631b6614794bc8fc7e9cf2d27187c16b5e84b78b8df4f37","ja":"お詫びのアメちゃん","zh":"道歉的小糖果","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8e7c3eba3d11ae8c2339a41870b021e4d034e9fdd606949f8da70e2c67c48559","ja":"CLEVER CLOVERゲネプロ公演の約4週間前、\n立稽古が始まったころのこと……。","zh":"CLEVER CLOVER正式演出彩排公演约4周前，开始进行排练的时候……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"01172a2a0e11e176f3b065e98dcfb79ed03f393030903f0528c1de4e70874b5f","ja":"「え……。わ、私……？」","zh":"“诶……我、我吗……？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3035dd24da4107b479b97a993c1dcbf320cfb27378bf8ccd0d6621afa2338736","ja":"「村のための栄誉ある役目。\nつつがなく全うするように」","zh":"为村子担当的光荣职责。\n请务必顺利完成。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"1bd3604432f433a4132ca6d577142e0530b735b07854dde7e3fc26677feb6feb","ja":"「ま、待ってください！　凛音亞（リンネア）は\n病弱なんです。ほんなら、私が代わりにやりま……」","zh":"「等、等一下！凛音亚她身体很虚弱。那就让我代替她……」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"484cb7f959c2dfc4dfa344d043de7e68ab32ad9de5c3e106d298a494590cfc47","ja":"あ、奈緒ちゃん、今のところ……。","zh":"啊，奈绪，目前……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"83f6b589350f75b2358a4a8d87f7bef16edf1d2fa5a807fedaa255d5540a184d","ja":"あかーん！　また関西弁が出てもうた～！！","zh":"不行！又不小心说关西腔了～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"a7e3017f68e76ae8912ecf32a4a10b9158dba51a000102e29c9372c385faee70","ja":"それに途中からアクセントも、\nなんやおかしなってもうて……すんません～！","zh":"而且从中途开始，连重音都变得奇怪了……对不起～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"75853bda5824495e342f77771730904be6f9769b826abb66fd084ef068c5caa3","ja":"いつもと違う話し方って、難しいよねぇ。\nあたしも苦労してるべさ。","zh":"用和平时不一样的方式说话，挺难的呢。\n我也很费劲呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"8617e0e28dab540aa4163f9ef7c20b4899d97191c4c6b661d9abd07396148c72","ja":"せやけど、ひなたはもう流暢な感じするで。\n村長の威厳？みたいなもんもあるし……。","zh":"不过，日向已经感觉挺流利的了。还有种村长的威严？之类的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"39034f3d301bebe62a273ffebd861bc4e7502ea6c4f0baf0be3d53595b61c279","ja":"そ、そうかい～？\nちゃんとできてるなら、うれしいねぇ。","zh":"这、这样啊～？\n要是做得不错，那就让人高兴了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"37983219cc258d7a21be99f0ae3e34307f641cf086d7a832fc81d89cca141bd5","ja":"安定感バッチリやん！　私は、さっきみたいに\n感情が高ぶるシーンとかになると、つい……。","zh":"稳定感十足嘛！我一到像刚才那样情绪高涨的场面，就会不由自主地……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"12d75ca43979fb4c636fa59fc017e6f03151ebf9a6f71664603cdf277d647112","ja":"感情を乗せつつ、アクセントも標準語に……。","zh":"带上感情，同时也要用标准语调……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"3e51f76712b6dd63f7b61538bcc7203dbfcc5f8fbe564b993d81457e78b7f4d0","ja":"繰り返しレッスンして、\n自然にできるようにならないとね。","zh":"要反复练习，直到能够自然而然地做到才行。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6f2ac17d5b4a1a9443388448284d6696ee3522a6b3ee5542c7baeb8543a200cb","ja":"そっか……そうですよね！\nよ～し、レッスンあるのみや～！","zh":"这样啊……确实是呢！\n好～接下来只能练习啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"77a503a912d8a3bc298455b898be6c33ed7020ec992bb78a4aedf18b0bb20b79","ja":"じゃ、さっきのシーンの続き……の前に、\n止めてもうたお詫びで……。","zh":"那么，在继续刚才的场景……之前，先为打断了你道个歉……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"4cfa96cdc54272ddd14139f3af7771f5aec64e50f86b13e736f776f0db27df71","ja":"アメちゃんあげます～！　みんなにも\n苦労かけますけど、練習、付き合ってください～！","zh":"给你们糖果～！大家也都有份哦  \n虽然会辛苦大家，但请陪我一起练习～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"f857ff7f45ccef984556a9b64c09ef1dd606ae800f03029b9f32e1023fe2c287","ja":"え？　苦労なんてそんなこと……でも、気遣い\nありがと♪　アメちゃん、ありがたくいただくわね。","zh":"诶？辛苦什么的，哪有这回事……不过，谢谢你的关心♪  \n糖果我就不客气地收下啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_990.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"211e10bb4b8376a87117c125972af061edc84381f1022f8bc10cb3daa0c5e9fc","ja":"奈緒さん、ありがとう。\nそれじゃあ、立稽古を続けようかねぇ。","zh":"奈绪，谢谢你。那我们继续排练走位吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
